  "Hints": [
    "<p>Replace every even element with <code>b</code> and every odd element with <code>-a</code>. A subarray is valid exactly when its transformed sum is at most <code>0</code>.</p>",
    "<p>The condition <code>y &gt; 0</code> is then automatic, because a non-empty subarray containing only even elements has a positive transformed sum.</p>",
    "<p>Let <code>pref[i]</code> be the prefix sum of the transformed array. A subarray <code>[l, r]</code> is valid when <code>pref[r + 1] &lt;= pref[l]</code>.</p>",
    "<p>Scan the prefix sums from left to right and count how many previous prefix sums are greater than or equal to the current one using coordinate compression and a Fenwick tree.</p>"
  ],
